    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489220/extras/3c30363f2d8361b193e94beae077f906.avif?t=1743953360\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b Wishlist, Please!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello, I\u2019m Happyone, the developer of <strong>Kkokko Industry</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Kkokko Industry has captured your heart, please add it to your wishlist. It\u2019s the best way to support us. Let\u2019s create this adorable game together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489220/extras/05d09be9a9a45e3466b4d3714bb8f4bf.avif?t=1743953360\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Welcome to Kkokko Industry</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever raised an adorable chick?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kkokko Industry is a relaxing idle game where you raise chickens on a small farm to produce eggs, sell them, and gradually expand your chicken farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489220/extras/bdf2c03033988f63fd00bd0e54ec32cb.avif?t=1743953360\" width=616 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Cozy Idle Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game runs on one side of your monitor, allowing you to enjoy it comfortably while working on other tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you suddenly feel curious about the cute chicks, take a glance at the game screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489220/extras/f93af59c3b364c92e9f60ea7624ad54c.avif?t=1743953360\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>a. Build your own chicken farm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Raise chickens to produce fresh eggs. Sell the eggs you produce and upgrade your chicken farm to make it even better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>b. Research new breeds and technologies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover new breeds of chickens and develop new technologies through research to maximize productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>c. Explore various areas</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pioneer diverse regions such as laboratories, ruins, wastelands, and harbors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Build chicken farms with themes tailored to each area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your relaxing yet rewarding chicken farm management today!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489220/extras/3c30363f2d8361b193e94beae077f906.avif?t=1743953360\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b Wishlist, Please!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello, I\u2019m Happyone, the developer of <strong>Kkokko Industry</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Kkokko Industry has captured your heart, please add it to your wishlist. It\u2019s the best way to support us. Let\u2019s create this adorable game together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489220/extras/05d09be9a9a45e3466b4d3714bb8f4bf.avif?t=1743953360\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Welcome to Kkokko Industry</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever raised an adorable chick?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kkokko Industry is a relaxing idle game where you raise chickens on a small farm to produce eggs, sell them, and gradually expand your chicken farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489220/extras/bdf2c03033988f63fd00bd0e54ec32cb.avif?t=1743953360\" width=616 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Cozy Idle Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game runs on one side of your monitor, allowing you to enjoy it comfortably while working on other tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you suddenly feel curious about the cute chicks, take a glance at the game screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489220/extras/f93af59c3b364c92e9f60ea7624ad54c.avif?t=1743953360\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>a. Build your own chicken farm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Raise chickens to produce fresh eggs. Sell the eggs you produce and upgrade your chicken farm to make it even better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>b. Research new breeds and technologies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover new breeds of chickens and develop new technologies through research to maximize productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>c. Explore various areas</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pioneer diverse regions such as laboratories, ruins, wastelands, and harbors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Build chicken farms with themes tailored to each area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your relaxing yet rewarding chicken farm management today!</p>",
